              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mary Ann B"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't make as many as called for for only two people. I loved the flavor the saltines gave it. I did not have cornmeal, and they still tasted delicious. I did not use as much oil as it called for, way too much. I sauteed them so it took a little longer and weren't greasy. I cook frog legs often and this will be my new coating to use. It did not fall off during frying.",
